[I] Glycin image loaders and GTK 4 bindings

[T] The sandboxed image loaders, the thumbnailer and the libglycin-gtk4
[T] bindings of Glycin, built against the installed libglycin.

[U] https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/glycin

[A] GNOME
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/graphic
[F] CROSS

[E] add libheif
[E] add libjxl
[R] - alpha arc avr32 blackfin cris hppa hppa64 i860 m68k microblaze nios2 openrisc superh

[L] MPL LGPL
[V] 2.2.6
